待办聚合统计待业务模块接入\"。我直接将这些信息反馈给用户。',NULL,NULL,'completed',393,'2026-08-07 21:04:59','2026-08-07 21:04:59',NULL,NULL,NULL),(40,'f84a52bc67554cbdb36ca018d344e7e4','4a6c0c9f96794a3c84d57ea508a81a03','user','帮我看看最近一周的考勤情况',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'completed',0,'2026-08-08 02:58:03','2026-08-08 02:58:03',NULL,NULL,NULL),(41,'f84a52bc67554cbdb36ca018d344e7e4','1c3b5fc9623348b780b882229e4cecee','assistant',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'用户想要查看最近一周的考勤情况。我需要调用查询考勤记录的工具，设置日期范围为最近一周（比如从今天往前推7天）。今天是2025年4月11日，所以日期范围应该是2025-04-04到2025-04-11。','[{\"id\": \"tc_c74fcfe802be51b7\", \"type\": \"function\", \"function\": {\"name\": \"query_attendance\", \"arguments\": \"{\\\"start_date\\\":\\\"2025-04-04\\\",\\\"end_date\\\":\\\"2025-04-11\\\"}\"}}]',NULL,'completed',0,'2026-08-08 02:58:07','2026-08-08 02:58:07','{\"name\": \"query_attendance\", \"arguments\": {\"end_date\": \"2025-04-11\", \"start_date\": \"2025-04-04\"}}',NULL,'executing'),(42,'f84a52bc67554cbdb36ca018d344e7e4','fe3345795e274f27beafb49349334ccf','tool','{\"success\":true,\"status_code\":200,\"body\":{\"code\":0,\"msg\":\"success\",\"data\":{\"list\":[],\"total\":0,\"page\":1,\"limit\":10}}}',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'{\"name\": \"query_attendance\", \"result\": {\"body\": {\"msg\": \"success\", \"code\": 0, \"data\": {\"list\": [], \"page\": 1, \"limit\": 10, \"total\": 0}}, \"success\": true, \"status_code\": 200}, \"arguments\": {\"end_date\": \"2025-04-11\", \"start_date\": \"2025-04-04\"}}','tc_c74fcfe802be51b7','completed',0,'2026-08-08 02:58:07','2026-08-08 02:58:07','{\"name\": \"query_attendance\", \"arguments\": {\"end_date\": \"2025-04-11\", \"start_date\": \"2025-04-04\"}}','{\"body\": {\"msg\": \"success\", \"code\": 0, \"data\": {\"list\": [], \"page\": 1, \"limit\": 10, \"total\": 0}}, \"success\": true, \"status_code\": 200}','success'),(43,'f84a52bc67554cbdb36ca018d344e7e4','cb3506da32f149b78635bb27e607129c','assistant','根据查询结果显示，**最近一周（2025-04-04 至 2025-04-11）的考勤记录为空**，没有找到相关的考勤数据。\n\n可能的原因：\n\n1. **日期范围设置有误**：请确认当前日期是否准