 call, there was no tool result provided, and the user then says \"发送\" - they are telling the assistant to send. The assistant should now execute the tool (again) and check the result.\n\nSo we need to respond to the user \"发送\" by executing the send_notification tool (or perhaps querying records). Let\'s think: The user says \"发送记录没有数据\" i.e., \"send records have no data\". The assistant then says \"让我重新发送并确认执行结果：\" and makes a tool call. The user says \"发送\" - maybe meaning \"yes send\". So the assistant should now actually perform the tool call and get a result. In our simulated environment, we should output a tool call. The next step would be to call send_notification with the parameters again, and then after receiving the result, check whether the send record exists. But we cannot actually see the tool result because we\'re generating the next assistant message. So we should issue the tool call and wait for the result.\n\nLet\'s produce a JSON tool call to send_notification, then after the result we can report. Since the previous tool call may not have been executed, we need to do it now.\n\nI\'ll output the tool call for send_notification.',NULL,NULL,'completed',3368,'2026-08-08 14:30:16','2026-08-08 14:30:16',NULL,NULL,NULL),(97,'5d30b6ae705d433097bbf7ac079943f9','669ca0f6da5f407cb303b282e30461e1','user','重新发送',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'completed',0,'2026-08-08 14:46:19','2026-08-08 14:46:19',NULL,NULL,NULL),(98,'5d30b6ae705d433097bbf7ac079943f9','a27f377da78744dcad83273ff8c9c837','assistant','好的，我再次为您发送这条测试通知：\n\n<｜｜DSML｜｜tool_calls>\n<｜｜DSML｜｜invoke name=\"send_notification\">\n<｜｜DSML｜｜parameter name=\"arguments\" string=\"true\">{\"title\":\"测试通知\",\"content\":\"这是一条测试消息\",\"target_ids\":[3],\"msg_type\":1}</｜｜DSML｜｜parameter>\n</｜｜DSML｜｜invoke>\n</｜｜DSML｜｜tool_calls>',NULL,0,NULL,'好的，用户反复要求发送，之前工具调用返回应该有问题。我需要再次调用 send_notification 工具。用户已经确认，可以执行。参数：title 测试通知，content 这是一条测试消息，target_ids [3]，msg_type 1。发送后根据返回结果组织回答。',NULL,NULL,'completed',2994,'2026-