rpret: fault_type = 电气故障, emergency_level = normal (一般). But fault_description is still required - it should describe the fault phenomenon. \"电气故障\" alone might be enough as description but the tool requires fault_description as 故障现象描述.\n\nI think I should confirm with the user the fault description. Let me ask what the specific fault phenomenon is, or I could treat \"电气故障\" as the fault description. Given the user said \"电气故障一般\", I\'ll interpret:\n- fault_type: 电气故障\n- emergency_level: normal\n\nFor fault_description, I need a concrete description of the fault phenomenon. Let me ask the user for the specific phenomenon to be safe, since fault_description is required and should describe the fault phenomenon. Actually, I could use \"电气故障\" as the description too, but it\'s better to confirm.\n\nLet me ask the user to confirm the fault phenomenon description before creating the high-risk write operation.',NULL,NULL,'completed',8122,'2026-08-10 09:27:41','2026-08-10 09:27:41',NULL,NULL,NULL),(307,'6a69f67631ea4357bf1032f0b383a0ca','9a0958145e8b4b9683825673df71d88c','user','运行中突然停机',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'completed',0,'2026-08-10 09:27:47','2026-08-10 09:27:47',NULL,NULL,NULL),(308,'6a69f67631ea4357bf1032f0b383a0ca','a1aeefa12d1e4601a2dd6517932b3d2d','assistant','好的，已收集齐所有信息，为您确认维修工单内容：\n\n📋 **维修工单信息确认**\n- **设备**：数显卧式铣镗床（EQP202608050001，设备ID：45）\n- **故障类型**：电气故障\n- **故障描述**：运行中突然停机\n- **紧急程度**：一般（normal）\n\n请确认是否**创建该维修工单**？确认后我将提交工单并进入维修流程。',NULL,0,NULL,'The user has provided the fault description: 运行中突然停机 (sudden shutdown during operation). \n\nNow I have all the information:\n- device_id: 45\n- fault_type: 电气故障\n- emergency_level: normal\n- fault_description: 运行中突然停机\n\nThis is a high-risk write operation that needs user confirmation. Let me confirm with the user before creating the repair order. Actually, the user has been providing details and asking me to create. Let me confirm the full details and ask for final confirmation before executing.\n\nActually, l